   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting sustainable development through UNESCO&apos;s programmes and sites</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO is seeking to partner with key actors of change, notably the private sector, to promote sustainable development. The partnership between UNESCO and abrdn Charitable Foundation (&quot;abrdn&quot;) which this Project fits into, seeks to promote the sustainable development of the European region, notably South East Europe and the Mediterranenan. UNESCO&apos;s Regional Bureau for Science and Culture will work with its partners and sites on the ground to promote research, education and projects working notably with UNESCO&apos;s intergovernmental science programmes (MAB and IHP, as well as IOC).</narrative>
  </description>
